  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 3.1.8 - 4.0.0;\n- EnumerationExtensions: Add Method 'GetDescription' to get the description attribute of an enum value. Add some Extensions for Dictionary: 'Clone', 'Copy'. No breacking changes.\n- Refactoring (a lot)\n- Obsolete methods removed (were already declared as errors)\n- Add Tools\n- Add Extensions\nVersion 3.1.7\n- StringHelper: Add Method 'GetLowerFrontCharacters' to get the first n characters of a string in lowercase.\nVersion 3.1.6\n- Add icon to the NuGet package.\nVersion 3.1.4\n- Change namespace from netaera.Localisation.Data to netaera.Data.Localisation for better clarity.\nVersion 3.1.3\n- Added Extensions for IMessages: `FormattedString()`.\nVersion 3.1.2\n- Added Method `IMessages AddRange(IEnumerable{IMessage} messages)` to IMessages.\n- Added Extensions for IMessages: `ToMessages()` and `ToMessagesSafe()` for casting a list of IMessages to a list of Messages.\nVersion 3.1.1\n- Added Properties `HasErrors`, `HasWarnings`, `HasInfos`, and `HasQuestions` to IMessages/Messages for easier status checking. \n- Obsolete methods in IMessages/Messages are now marked as errors.\nVersion 3.1.0\n- Added async support for IO operations \nVersion 3.0.3\n- Changed the return value from 'void' to 'IDataRow' in the Add method of IDataRow\n- Mark the Add(String) method of IDataRow as obsolete and recommend using Add(Object) instead.\nVersion 3.0.2\nFix: In `Messages`, the implementation of the methods `Add` and `AddRange` has been adjusted to correctly use the base class.\nVersion 3.0.1\n- Updated some NuGet packages to their latest versions.\n- Introduction of the `Services` class in the `netaera.Reflection` namespace for instantiating objects..\nVersion 3.0.0\n- Some changes to the signatures of the IMessages interface to maintain compliance.\t\t\t\nVersion 2.2.11\n- Add some Extensions for generic Lists: GetElementOrDefaultSafe, GetElementOrNullSafe, GetElementOrNullSafeRef",
